From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: N0zoM1z0 <161784452+N0zoM1z0@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:03:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Decompile sub_3F8A() into dots.cpp

Like sparks_add() in spark.cpp, it calls vector2() in SHARED with a near
call, written as inline assembly with a near declaration. Its call to
circle_dot_put() has no NOP, so it was compiled in the same TU after
that function. The page coordinate code is pseudo-register C.
---
 Tupfile.lua            |   1 -
 th02/main/dots.cpp     |  82 +++++++++++++++++++
 th02/main/dots_upd.asm | 179 -----------------------------------------
 3 files changed, 82 insertions(+), 180 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 th02/main/dots_upd.asm

